{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","page":"ᰛᰬᰮ ᰗᰦᰮ ᰓᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰌᰧᰵᰶ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰝᰥᰩᰵ [1] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰠ ᰓᰦ ᰃᰩ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰣᰩᰵ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰜᰧ [2] ᰓᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰃᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰗᰦᰮ ᰋᰨ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [3] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰝᰥᰩᰱ ᰠ ᰊᰬ ᰆᰩᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰦ [4] ᰀ ᰀᰦ ᰊᰦᰳ ᰓᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰌᰪᰳ ᰠ ᰕᰫᰵ ᰠ ᰠᰪᰮ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ [5] ᰀᰦ ᰣᰩᰵ ᰛᰤᰬᰮ ᰅᰭᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰉᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰃᰩ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰃᰩ ᰀᰥᰩᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ [6] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰝᰩ ᰈᰬᰰ ᰀᰪᰮ ᰌᰫᰵ ᰠ ᰕ ᰌᰫᰭ [7] ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰝᰩ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰍᰦ ᰢ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ [8] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰫᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰊᰧ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰋᰦᰱ ᰓᰫ [9] ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰜᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰀᰦ ᰀᰦᰲ ᰡᰨ ᰚᰨᰵ [10] ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰩᰵ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰜᰨ ᰃᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰓᰦᰰ [11] ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰝᰤᰨᰱ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰃᰥᰧ [12] ᰀᰦ ᰋᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰃᰥᰧ ᰀᰦ ᰋᰧ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ [13] ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰀ ᰊᰧ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰋᰦᰱ ᰓᰫ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰜᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰀᰦ ᰋᰦᰱ ᰎ [14] ᰜᰬᰯ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰍᰦᰮ ᰃᰥᰩᰱ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰉᰧ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰋᰫᰭ [15] ᰀᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰀᰶ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰔᰬᰰ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰠ ᰕᰦᰳ [16] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰓᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰋᰦ ᰕ ᰛᰩ [17] ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰛᰪᰮ ᰌᰦᰲ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰜᰤᰨᰳ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰕ ᰛᰩ ᰃᰪᰰ [18] ᰍ ᰎᰩᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰣᰩᰱ ᰎᰦ ᰀᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰣᰫᰰ [19] ᰊᰦ ᰠ ᰙᰩᰵ ᰎᰫ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰕ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰍ ᰊᰨ ᰠ ᰆᰩᰵ ᰕ [20] ᰆᰩᰵ ᰍ ᰌᰤᰩᰮ ᰅᰭᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰌᰪᰮ ᰌᰩᰵ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰠᰦᰰ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰌᰦᰰ ᰜ ᰊᰨ ᰠ ᰛᰤᰫ [21] ᰕ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰍᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰕ ᰛᰩ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰠ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰛᰧᰳᰶ ᰣᰩᰵ [22] ᰍᰩᰵ ᰉᰧᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰎᰩᰵ ᰛᰪᰮ ᰌᰦᰲ ᰀᰪᰰ ᰛᰬ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ [23] ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰝᰦᰰ ᰍ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰠ ᰚᰪ ᰕᰫ ᰚᰪ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰉᰬᰳ ᰊ [24] ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰉᰧᰮᰶ ᰜ ᰎᰪᰰ [25] ᰠᰦᰰ ᰎᰪᰲ ᰌᰦᰰ ᰓᰪ ᰡᰩᰵ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰊᰧᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰍᰪᰰ [26] ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰢᰨ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠ ᰛᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰊᰤᰬᰳ ᰕᰫ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ [27] ᰀᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰀᰫᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰍᰩᰲ ᰎᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰉᰩ ᰓᰨ ᰢᰨ [28] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ [29] ᰓᰦ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰠ ᰍᰩᰲ ᰎᰫ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰎᰤᰦᰵ ᰓᰨ ᰜ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰂᰩᰭ ᰕ ᰜᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ [30] ᰚᰨ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰓᰧᰰᰶ ᰕ ᰋᰪᰱ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ [31] ᰚᰩᰵ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰊᰧᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰀ ᰜᰤᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ [32] ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰕ ᰛᰩ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰜᰪᰵ [33] ᰛᰪᰮ ᰌᰦᰲ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰆᰧ ᰙᰨ ᰚᰴ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰜᰩᰭ ᰗᰫᰳ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰩᰭ [34] ᰗᰫᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰌᰦᰲ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰍᰧᰵᰶ ᰓᰪᰭ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰋᰦ ᰠ ᰊᰤᰬᰳ ᰕᰫ ᰀᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ [35] ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰫ ᰆᰪᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰌᰤᰬᰱ ᰀᰦ ᰅᰦᰰ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰈᰬᰲ ᰠ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰆᰧᰮᰶ [36] ᰀᰦ ᰆᰧ ᰋᰩᰵ ᰅᰦᰰ ᰉᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰆᰧᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰜᰤᰦᰭ [37] ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰚᰪ ᰆᰪᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰀ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰆᰧᰮᰶ ᰛᰬᰮ ᰀᰤᰧᰳᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰍᰩᰲ [38] ᰎᰫ ᰠ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰆᰧᰮᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰖᰤᰬᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰀᰥᰩᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰃᰥᰦᰮ ᰓᰧ ᰑᰦᰳ [39] ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰜᰤᰦᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰜᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰕᰪᰮ ᰌᰧ [40] ᰚᰨ ᰜᰤᰧᰭᰶ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ [41] ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰝᰩ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰎᰪᰰ ᰌᰧ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰍᰫ [42] ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰝᰩ ᰈᰦ ᰃᰥᰪᰮ ᰕ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰍᰫ [43] ᰢᰨ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ ᰣᰦ ᰈᰬᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰀᰫ ᰕ ᰇᰳᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰈᰦ [44] ᰃᰥᰪᰮ ᰕ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰍᰫ ᰢᰨ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰜᰮᰶ ᰓᰫ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰋᰦᰭ ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰪ [45] ᰓᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰙᰨᰵ ᰆᰪ ᰀᰪᰱ ᰠ ᰣᰤᰪᰭ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰎᰰ ᰌᰧ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰕ [46] ᰢᰩᰵ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰨ ᰡᰪ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ [47] ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰌᰩᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰕᰩᰭ ᰠ ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [48] ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰈᰦ ᰃᰥᰪᰮ ᰕ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰍᰫ ᰢᰨ ᰼ ᰊ ᰣᰤᰪ [49] ᰕᰩᰳ ᰣᰦ ᰈᰬᰰ ᰓᰫ ᰛᰬ ᰌᰤᰦᰵ ᰜᰤᰩᰭ ᰠ ᰃᰥᰦᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ ᰀᰥᰧᰭᰶ ᰜᰱᰶ [50] ","annotations":[{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"1","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r1","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰛᰬᰮ ᰗᰦᰮ ᰓᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰌᰧᰵᰶ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰝᰥᰩᰵ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default#xywh=483,340,2317,151"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"2","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r2","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰜᰪᰵ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰠ ᰓᰦ ᰃᰩ ᰚᰨ ᰜᰧ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰣᰩᰵ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰜᰧ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default#xywh=364,472,2459,151"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"3","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r3","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰓᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰝᰩ ᰌᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰃᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰗᰦᰮ ᰋᰨ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰣᰨ ᰼","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default#xywh=400,601,2310,160"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"4","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r4","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰝᰥᰩᰱ ᰠ ᰊᰬ ᰆᰩᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰦ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default#xywh=394,750,2334,154"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"5","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r5","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰀ ᰀᰦ ᰊᰦᰳ ᰓᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰌᰪᰳ ᰠ ᰕᰫᰵ ᰠ ᰠᰪᰮ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default#xywh=370,906,2424,157"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"6","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326433\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r6","type":"Annotation","motivation